    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... it doesn't feel like i'm just \"occupying space.\" it feels like im stealing it. like every day i breathe, i'm taking a breath that should have belonged to them. it feels so wrong. like i'm just a placeholder for someone who actually deserved to live. how am i supposed to find peace when my very existence feels like a mistake?",
