      "content": "i don't want stillness. stillness just makes it louder. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to balance the scales, you know? like there's this cosmic imbalance because i'm still here and they aren't. it's like i'm living on borrowed time and the debt is just getting bigger every single day. wouldn't it make more sense if the scales were actually even?",
